# CODEOWNERS.example — team-mode ownership (rename to CODEOWNERS to enable;
# location per your platform: repo root, .github/, or docs/).
#
# Solo mode needs none of this. In team mode, the knowledge base and the
# always-loaded rules files get explicit owners so gardening/promotion PRs
# and AGENTS.md changes always reach a responsible reviewer ("gardener
# duty" — rotate this among the team).
#
# docs/knowledge/  @your-team/knowledge-gardeners
# AGENTS.md        @your-team/leads
# **/AGENTS.md     @your-team/leads
# .claude/rules/   @your-team/leads
